<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51763" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθετ-ήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθίημι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything let down into,
				inserted</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>plug of lint, pessary</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.157a
			</span></i>p.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.107
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθετηρίῳ</span> codd. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>surgical instrument</i> for emptying the bladder, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.125
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.59
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἀρρενικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Oss.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>fishing-line</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθεμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nicostr.Com.
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).287
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				68
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
